{
 "sheet": "effects",
 "doc": "Particle emitters of each ability, drawn by the DLL with Fiddlesticks' own particle textures and 3D crow from the player's League. trigger: missile_head (the missile itself), missile_trail (rate along the flight), hit (burst on each target hit), area (burst at the cast point), feared (rate around a feared target's head), tether_beam (beam caster->each drained target), tether_flow (rate, particles home from target to caster), channel (W, rate at caster), final (W last tick, burst on each target), r_channel / storm (R, rate around caster). texture: league_assets id or crow (3D raven). render: billboard | stretched (along velocity) | ground (flat, turned to the cast direction) | beam | model. size in m (model: x the League crow's size); radius: spawn radius or orbit radius in m, or 'ability' = the ability's radius. motion: free | orbit (circles the caster, spin = angular speed) | home (flies to the caster). colors RRGGBBAA, start -> end over life. frames = atlas cells per side (a random cell per particle).",
